==Strategy==
Due to the sheer power in this stage, it is heavily recommended that you use either UL Legend True Forms or Ubers. The presence of Daboo demands a holy blast cannon, preferably at level 20+.

The main threats of the stage is the combination of Daboo and Kurocroc, who form a wall that takes a lot of effort to push back. Your top priority is to neutralize Daboo, with a combination of the units you bring and the holy blast cannon to snipe him when he's "dead". However, the presence of the Cadaver Bears forces you to decide between using the holy blast to chip down Daboo or forcing the Bears to resurface. Due to the sheer pushing power of the cadaver bears, it is recommended that you use the holy blast to force the cadaver bears to resurface as soon as they attempt to burrow, and dispatch of them as soon as possible.

Money is very scarce in this stage, so any cheap units or units that are able to hold the line for a while can find use here. One such unit is [[Ancient Egg: N112 (Rare Cat)|Egg Pod]], who has quite a lot of bulk and a 50% chance to dodge the attacks from the behemoths in the stage.

